<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Amgen EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Amgen EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Gruntal &amp; Co Inc said Monday it raised its EPS estimates on biotech company Amgen Inc for the next three years, to $2.40 (from $2.35) for 1996, to $2.80 (from $2.70) for 1997 and to $3.20 (from $3.15) for 1998.</p>
<p>--&quot;Amgen appears undervalued in our opinion,&quot; Gruntal noted in a report, citing the company's historical track record, above-average earnings growth, cash-rich balance sheet and strong pipeline of biotech agents.</p>
<p>--Amgen was trading at 60, up 1/8.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
